# See the root .dockerignore for why rules must NOT have trailing slashes:
# az acr build only strips them for `!` negations, so `build/` never matches.
# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include exactly what the Dockerfile COPYs.
#
# Note: a 30 MiB compiled 'event-processor' binary is often left in this
# directory by local 'go build'. The allowlist below keeps it out of the upload.

*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!main.go
